flowchart TB
 U[Approved users] --> DNS[Route 53]
 DNS --> ALB[Internet-facing ALB HTTPS 443<br/>ACM certificate]
 subgraph VPC["VPC 10.30.0.0/16 — us-east-1 — two AZs"]
  IGW[Internet Gateway]
  VGW[Virtual Private Gateway]
  subgraph PUB["Public subnets A/B"]
   ALB
   N1[NAT Gateway A]
   N2[NAT Gateway B]
  end
  subgraph APP["Private application subnets A/B"]
   ASG[Auto Scaling Group<br/>desired capacity 2]
   A[EC2 app A<br/>4 vCPU / 16 GiB]
   B[EC2 app B<br/>4 vCPU / 16 GiB]
   ASG --> A
   ASG --> B
  end
  subgraph DB["Isolated DB subnets A/B"]
   R[(RDS PostgreSQL Multi-AZ DB instance<br/>primary + standby<br/>500 GB logical data)]
  end
  E[(Regional EFS<br/>1 TB; mount targets A/B)]
  S3EP[S3 Gateway Endpoint]
  S[(S3 archives<br/>500 GB)]
  C[CloudWatch]
  M[Systems Manager / Secrets Manager]
  subgraph MIG["Private migration-only subnet"]
   STG[MGN staging area<br/>replication servers]
  end
  IGW --> ALB
  ALB --> A
  ALB --> B
  A --> R
  B --> R
  A --> E
  B --> E
  A --> S3EP
  B --> S3EP
  S3EP --> S
  A --> C
  B --> C
  A --> M
  B --> M
  A --> N1
  B --> N2
  VGW --- APP
  VGW --- DB
 end
 O[On-premises / VirtualBox source] <-->|Site-to-Site VPN tunnels| VGW
 SRC[Source server with MGN agent] -. secure replication traffic .-> STG
 MGN[AWS Application Migration Service] -. orchestrates .-> STG
 DMS[AWS DMS replication instance / serverless migration] -. full load + CDC .-> R
 PG[Self-managed PostgreSQL source] -. database connection / CDC .-> DMS
 DS[AWS DataSync] -. NFS data transfer .-> E
 DS -. archive transfer .-> S
